---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About FixLanka Tools — Free, Private Online Tools"
  description="Learn about FixLanka Tools: free in-browser utilities to compress photos, merge PDFs, and protect your privacy without server uploads."
  canonicalUrl="https://fixlanka.com/about"
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16 space-y-8">
    <header class="space-y-3">
      <span class="inline-block text-xs font-medium px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 border border-brand-500/20">
        About FixLanka
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-dark-text tracking-tight">
        Private tools for everyday tasks, right in your browser
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-dark-secondary leading-relaxed">
        FixLanka Tools was created to make working with photos, PDFs, and everyday files simple, fast, and completely private.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-dark-secondary leading-relaxed">
      <section class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-card border border-dark-border space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-dark-text">Why we built FixLanka</h2>
        <p>
          Too many simple everyday tasks—like shrinking a photo for WhatsApp or email, combining PDF pages for a job application, or making a quick QR code—force you to upload sensitive files to unknown cloud servers, wait in lines, or pay monthly fees.
        </p>
        <p>
          FixLanka changes that. Every single tool runs directly inside your web browser on your phone, tablet, or computer. Your personal photos, tax records, and family documents never leave your hands.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark-text">Our promises to you</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-dark-card border border-dark-border">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-dark-text mb-1">1. Your files stay with you</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-dark-secondary">
              Files are processed in your device's memory. Nothing is ever sent to or stored on our servers.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-dark-card border border-dark-border">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-dark-text mb-1">2. No sign-up or accounts</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-dark-secondary">
              No forms, emails, or passwords. Click any tool and start using it immediately.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-dark-card border border-dark-border">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-dark-text mb-1">3. 100% free forever</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-dark-secondary">
              No hidden subscriptions, surprise paywalls, or feature limits.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-dark-card border border-dark-border">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-dark-text mb-1">4. Built for everyone worldwide</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-dark-secondary">
              Proudly built in Sri Lanka and made available for free to people everywhere on earth.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-card border border-dark-border space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-dark-text">How it works</h2>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed">
          When you select a file on FixLanka, your web browser uses its own built-in computing power to perform the task locally. That means it works even if your internet connection is slow or drops out after the page loads.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>